[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "石化の息は、晴れたか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The petrifying breath has cleared..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "タイニー……！\u3000クソッ、やっぱりお前に\nついていてやれば……！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny...! Damn it, I should've stayed with you...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "折れない顔をした石像は生意気だが、\nこの恐怖に怯えた顔の石像はいいな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Statues with defiant faces are insolent, but these statues frozen in terror—now these are quite nice."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "てめえ、７回殺しても飽き足りねえ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You bastard... I could kill you seven times over and it wouldn't be enough...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだ、別働隊がいたのか。\nそれぐらいは頭を使ってくるか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? So there was a separate team. At least you used your heads that much."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺は寛大だ。頭を下げて服従するか、\n一緒に石像になるか、選ばせてやるぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm generous. I'll let you choose—bow down and submit, or become statues together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "チッ……好き勝手言ってくれやがる……\nけど、興味を持ってくれたのはありがたいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch... You sure talk big... But I appreciate you taking an interest."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "石像にできるもんならしてみやがれ！\n俺もなりたくはないんでね、全力で抵抗してやる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go ahead and try turning me to stone! I don't plan on making it easy—I'll resist with everything I've got!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "面白い武器じゃないか。それならば石の息を貫ける。\nだが、肝心の自身の身が危ういぞ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An interesting weapon you have. With that, you might pierce through the petrifying breath. But what about protecting yourself?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "簡単だよ。息より先に別のもので満たしちまえばいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Simple. Just fill the space with something else before the breath reaches us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほう、そんな手があったか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, so that's your play."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ったく、タイニー、重くなりやがったな……\nって、これ石になっても聞こえてたらヤバいか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geez, Tiny, you've gotten heavier... Wait, this is gonna be awkward if she can somehow hear me while petrified."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "チッ、持っていけるのは１人が限度だね……\nそれじゃあ私は――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Damn, I can only carry one person at a time... Guess I'll—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "させん！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I won't let you!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "んなっ！？\u3000こいつ、見えてんの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! This guy can see me?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと、私を忘れないでよねっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, don't forget about me!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ナナか、お前は後で遊んでやる。\nもうちょっと待っていろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, Nana. I'll play with you later. Just wait a little longer."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "嫌だね！\u3000今遊んでよ、お兄ちゃん！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No way! Play with me now, big brother!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "シトリン、アタシらもやるよ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine, we're jumping in too!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "シトリン、お前、また俺にお仕置きされたいのか？\n分からされたいのか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine, do you want me to punish you again? Do you need another lesson?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐっ……い、いや、僕は",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Urgh... N-No, I—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "決めた、お前はお仕置きだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Too late. I've decided. You're getting punished."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ど、どっち道そうなるなら、やってやる！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-If it's happening either way, then I'll fight back!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まったく……手の掛かる奴らだ。\n今一度兄の偉大さを分からせてやる必要があるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Such troublesome children... It seems I need to remind you all of your elder brother's greatness once more."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょうどいい機会だ。とことん打ち据えてやる。\nお前たちが参ったと言うまでな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is the perfect opportunity. I'll beat you down thoroughly—until you beg for mercy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なに、殺しはしない。\n……死んだほうがマシだと思うかもしれんが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't worry, I won't kill you. ...Though you might wish I had."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここは私たちが引き受ける！\n今はいったん逃げて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll handle this! Everyone else, fall back for now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ、そうする！\u3000この石化を解く薬を\nなんとか用意して戻ってくるから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right, we're going! I'll find a way to make an antidote for this petrification and come back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それまで持ちこたえてくれよ、相棒！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold out until then, partner!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるべく早く戻ってきてよ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You better come back soon!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふ、一人だけ持ち帰ったところでどうなる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph. What difference will rescuing one person make?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "パルメ族に選ばれた錬金術士といっても、\n所詮はこの程度か",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this is all the Palme's chosen alchemist amounts to in the end."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やはり、この星を任せられる器ではない……\n英雄ヘルト様が「管理」してやらねばな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Clearly, you lack the capacity to be entrusted with this world... The great hero Held will have to 'manage' it himself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだ終わってないでしょ！\n私たちに参ったって言わせてみなさいよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This isn't over yet! Try making us beg for mercy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\n",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "雷鳴の島決戦、初戦は惨敗……だね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Battle of Thundering Isle, round one—a crushing defeat."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ……だが、まだ完全に負けたわけじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... But we haven't completely lost yet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "タイニー、絶対に助けてやるからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tiny, I swear I'll save you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ジョゼ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "José"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]